{"game": "deep-rock-galactic", "language": "schinese", "appid": 548430, "month": "2018-04", "window": 1, "start_date": 1522540800, "end_date": 1523231999, "month_true_total": 74, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:50:49 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "41362568", "author": {"steamid": "76561198100565671", "personaname": "劲爆大象部落", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198100565671/", "num_games_owned": 395, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 4095, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1338, "last_played": 1569511931, "avatar": "9aed8e70c050601645e4db4fbe659d0ef26ee705"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "我的存档无故消失，我玩了22小时，所有我解锁的科技，经验，金币，全部都消失了\n在我上一次打开游戏之前，我没有启动过我的电脑，所以我可以肯定不是我本机电脑的存档被人动过了\n这款游戏里的账号信息应该都是存在游戏公司的服务器里的\n我已经没有动力打下去了", "timestamp_created": 1523195358, "timestamp_updated": 1523195358, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 18, "votes_funny": 10, "weighted_vote_score": "0.645977377891540527", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41354849", "author": {"steamid": "76561198145619108", "personaname": "备战小升初", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198145619108/", "num_games_owned": 406, "num_reviews": 41, "playtime_forever": 16241, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1226, "last_played": 1722693785, "avatar": "7955df98fda4ee98439937eecc21c4cf38c461ad"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "很快就升满级了，满级就不是很想玩了，但是玩个10小时没问题，这个价位很值。", "timestamp_created": 1523162915, "timestamp_updated": 1523162915, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.530319750308990479", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41354184", "author": {"steamid": "76561198187047373", "personaname": "Lucky缘", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198187047373/", "num_games_owned": 205, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 4519, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2879, "last_played": 1666801603, "avatar": "ee8785542b8ccea38dc11636218fb5b3e2770d95"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "什么破游戏！一个20级带队走碰到虫群救不救把人推下去后还问另一个人去哪里了！还国人好好个屁屁都能蹦飞了！", "timestamp_created": 1523159472, "timestamp_updated": 1523159472, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.480183035135269165", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41352705", "author": {"steamid": "76561198109918766", "personaname": "梦中仙", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198109918766/", "num_games_owned": 88, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 37867, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7754, "last_played": 1707627583, "avatar": "28c5d9783ed598a5e309ed2ed49bc88f5f91bbc8"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "我四个人物已经20级 号也26满级了  时装全黑岩mk2  所有dlc全买过了 这么说我是非常喜欢此游戏的 但是我想就我遇到的问题跟大家说一下  有一次我们4个人完成任务回救生舱 我抢手发现没有绳子了就叫了一个补给  拿了补给切换3的时候游戏崩溃  我们这局玩了37分钟 最高难度  因为救生舱刷新位置在一个只有绳子才好上去的地方  怪还很多因为我的一根绳子  团灭  游戏画质我调的中等  那时候知道我多么内疚么？  除了这个例子  还有玩着玩着掉线 主机崩溃 失去连接  玩五把  就会出现一把  等等  这些问题都是在人多的时候出现的 服务器房间如果只有两个房  这些问题就很少出现  希望开发组快点解决\n\n2年了  现在很好玩  都很好", "timestamp_created": 1523150952, "timestamp_updated": 1594201889, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.583707809448242188", "comment_count": 2, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "41335608", "author": {"steamid": "76561198236443512", "personaname": "鱼鱼虾仁饭", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/LKarrie/", "num_games_owned": 432, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 27948, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 832, "last_played": 1723731131, "avatar": "2ec29c8674b914788e97fac21543ae73fcc0d938"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "很好玩的游戏,就是找不到CN的房间,常在的都是外国人,联机玩带带带带带上我！加加加加加好友！", "timestamp_created": 1523090867, "timestamp_updated": 1523090867, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 10, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.604513406753540039", "comment_count": 5, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1519804887", "reactions": []}]}